<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58212" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνῑσόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κνισάω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Matro
				<u>Conv.</u>
				82
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἑαυτῶν ψυχὰς κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.628
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>turn into fatty smoke</i>, in 
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέλεαρ κεκνισωμένον</span>
			<i>savoury</i> bait, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				534b5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποθυμιατέον βδέλλαις -ουμέναις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.19.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ κνισοῦται τὰ σιτία κατὰ τὴν
					γαστέρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.37
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.691
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				706
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ἰχθῦς κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὸν ζωμόν</span>
			<i>burn</i> the soup, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Sat.</u>
				23
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>become greasy</i>, of oil after boiling, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.37.3
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἐκ τῆς ἑψήσεως
				κεκνισ&lt;ω&gt;μένον ἔλαιον</span> prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.69
			</span></i>.</div>
